      "assistant_text": "According to [[credential-scoping]], the Anthropic API key is **injected into the environment of the spawned child process immediately before that process starts**. \n\nSpecifically:\n- A local secrets loader reads the key from a git-ignored \u0060.env\u0060 file at startup\n- The key is injected only into the environment of the spawned Ingest agent (or Query agent) child process\n- The Hub\u0027s own process environment is never mutated or holds the key\n\nThis design ensures that a compromised Hub process cannot leak the credential by inspecting its own environment variables \u2014 the key exists only inside the short-lived child process that actually needs to call the Anthropic API.",
